<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Regional Resources listing suspended.</title>
<headline>Regional Resources listing suspended.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Monday that Regional Resources Ltd's listing had been suspended after it failed to submit its provisional annual results.</p>
<p>It said the suspension would take effect immediately, pending the convening of a special meeting of the exchange's general committee.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
